  "language_raw": "English",
  "source": "message/dat/English/script/class_b_06.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/English/script/class_b_06.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_01",
      "hash64": "4C786A4AA1E1E046",
      "text": "Hello, everyone. Let’s have a fun class today.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_02",
      "hash64": "4C78694AA1E1DE93",
      "text": "Did you make sure to review last class’s material\\nin order to stay “sharp”?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_03",
      "hash64": "4C78684AA1E1DCE0",
      "text": "I know it was a little difficult with all that talk of\\nmultiplication and percentages and the like.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_04",
      "hash64": "4C786F4AA1E1E8C5",
      "text": "But today, we’ll be talking about percentages\\nagain to learn about probability.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_05",
      "hash64": "4C786E4AA1E1E712",
      "text": "That may sound like we’re going to have another\\ndifficult class, but did you know that all of you\\r\\nalready deal with probability on a regular basis?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_06",
      "hash64": "4C786D4AA1E1E55F",
      "text": "Pokémon moves generally have a property called\\naccuracy, which determines the probability that\\r\\nthey will hit.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_07",
      "hash64": "4C786C4AA1E1E3AC",
      "text": "The accuracy of Tackle is 100—or 100 percent.\\nSo if you were to use Tackle 100 times, you\\r\\ncould expect it to hit all 100 times![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_08",
      "hash64": "4C78734AA1E1EF91",
      "text": "The move Hypnosis, which puts opponents to\\nsleep, has an accuracy of 60—or 60 percent.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_09",
      "hash64": "4C78724AA1E1EDDE",
      "text": "That means you could expect it to hit 60 times\\nin 100 uses. To put that another way—out of 100\\r\\nuses, you could expect it to miss 40 times![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_10",
      "hash64": "4C74E54AA1DEC870",
      "text": "Many of the truly powerful moves often tend to\\nhave lower accuracy.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_11",
      "hash64": "4C74E64AA1DECA23",
      "text": "So when you’re deciding whether to go slow and\\nsteady with moves that are sure to hit, or hard\\r\\nand fast with stronger but less accurate moves...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_12",
      "hash64": "4C74E74AA1DECBD6",
      "text": "you’re already studying probability![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_13",
      "hash64": "4C74E84AA1DECD89",
      "text": "Let me see here... Perhaps Surf and Hydro Pump\\nwould be good examples for this discussion?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_14",
      "hash64": "4C74E94AA1DECF3C",
      "text": "Surf has a power of 90. Its accuracy is 100,\\nmeaning you can expect it to hit every time.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_15",
      "hash64": "4C74EA4AA1DED0EF",
      "text": "Hydro Pump’s accuracy is only 80—but when it\\nhits, its power is 110![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_16",
      "hash64": "4C74EB4AA1DED2A2",
      "text": "So, between Surf and Hydro Pump, which move\\nwould you want to use yourselves?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_b_06_select_01",
      "hash64": "669BEC9254F0EEB0",
      "text": "I’d use Surf",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_b_06_select_02",
      "hash64": "669BEF9254F0F3C9",
      "text": "I’d use Hydro Pump",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_b_06_select_03",
      "hash64": "669BEE9254F0F216",
      "text": "It depends on the situation",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_answer_01",
      "hash64": "9038381829CEBDC7",
      "text": "Oh my. I see it’s “slow and steady wins the race”\\nfor you, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_answer_02",
      "hash64": "9038391829CEBF7A",
      "text": "Oh my. I see you like the risky, adventurous side\\nof things, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_answer_03",
      "hash64": "90383A1829CEC12D",
      "text": "Oh my. I see you’re always considering various\\npossibilities, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_17",
      "hash64": "4C74EC4AA1DED455",
      "text": "I may have made it sound like there was a correct\\nanswer here, but there’s not!\\c\\nYou’re free to use any moves you wish![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_18",
      "hash64": "4C74ED4AA1DED608",
      "text": "Factors like PP or number of targets hit may make\\nsome moves more suited to certain situations.\\c\\nHowever, trading accuracy for power or vice\\nversa is purely a matter of preference![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 182,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_19",
      "hash64": "4C74EE4AA1DED7BB",
      "text": "This Surf-versus-Hydro Pump debate has been\\nongoing for quite some time.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_20",
      "hash64": "4C7EF74AA1E73B8B",
      "text": "Personally, I’m more invested in debating the\\nRock-type moves Rock Slide and Stone Edge.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_21",
      "hash64": "4C7EF64AA1E739D8",
      "text": "Let me tell you, I could get really worked up\\ntalking about those moves, but—\\c\\nOh, my. There’s the bell. What a shame.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_22",
      "hash64": "4C7EF94AA1E73EF1",
      "text": "Next class will be the last of our time together,\\nso show up 100 percent ready to go![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
